@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/folder_items/{folder_item_uuid}/actions/unpin/invoke
actor "The client ." as Client
participant "Controller is RestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nFOLDER_ITEM + The container is tied up ." as DB
queue "It 's a transaction . outbox" as OUT
queue "Typed projected folder task" as TASK
participant "The worker pool ." as WORKER
database "The public events repository" as EVENT
participant "The controller . WebSocket" as DISP
participant "Signed client" as WS
Client -> API: POST The unit (Without a body.)
note right of API
  Changing the placement layer (placement), not automatic rule/membership.
  The projection: active USER_STREAM_BINDING + It 's canonical . STREAM.is_archived = false.
  All chats = All of them .; Personal = STREAM.private = true; Channels = STREAM.private = false.
end note
API -> DB: BEGIN; block the element in the specified area
API -> DB: set it up pinned_at = NULL
API -> OUT: I 'm going to add folder_item.unpin
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Client: 200 JSON The element
OUT -> TASK: immutable folder_projection(outbox_event_uuid)\nscope=user-folder; without coalescing
TASK -> WORKER: claim user-folder(project,user,folder)\nlease + fencing
WORKER -> DB: I 'm going to read it . normalized items + ready stream counts
group One . worker DB transaction
  WORKER -> DB: replace deterministic snapshot + counts\nversion/updated_at
  WORKER -> EVENT: ready folder.updated + unique effect guard
end
DISP -> EVENT: read/repeat/play
DISP -> WS: folder.updated
@enduml
